WEBVTT

01:44.000 --> 01:47.460
OBEY THE MONSTERS
<i>As you can see from the pitiful state</i>
<i>of the Hero Association</i>

01:47.460 --> 01:49.800
OBEY THE MONSTERS
<i>humanity has no chance of winning.</i>

01:49.800 --> 01:50.010
OBEY THE MONSTERS

01:50.010 --> 01:51.010
OBEY THE MONSTERS
<i>We must surrender completely.</i>

01:51.010 --> 01:52.130
<i>We must surrender completely.</i>

01:52.380 --> 01:56.300
COOPERATE WITH THE MONSTERS
HUMANITY CANNOT WIN!!
<i>If we resist, it's certain</i>
<i>we'll all be slaughtered.</i>

01:56.300 --> 01:56.550
COOPERATE WITH THE MONSTERS
HUMANITY CANNOT WIN!!

01:56.550 --> 01:59.220
COOPERATE WITH THE MONSTERS
HUMANITY CANNOT WIN!!
<i>And therefore,</i>
<i>the Monster Worship Party has come up</i>

01:59.520 --> 02:01.940
<i>with the only possible solution.</i>

02:02.020 --> 02:02.350
MONSTER WORSHIP
OBEY THE MONSTERS

02:02.350 --> 02:06.060
MONSTER WORSHIP
OBEY THE MONSTERS
<i>By offering human sacrifices</i>
<i>regularly to the monsters</i>

02:06.060 --> 02:08.690
MONSTER WORSHIP
OBEY THE MONSTERS
<i>and controlling</i>
<i>their rate of consumption</i>

02:08.690 --> 02:09.030
MONSTER WORSHIP
OBEY THE MONSTERS
<i>we can avoid the complete extinction</i>
<i>of our species.</i>

02:09.030 --> 02:11.360
<i>we can avoid the complete extinction</i>
<i>of our species.</i>

02:12.200 --> 02:16.870
<i>Those of you who want to side</i>
<i>with the monsters, come with us!</i>

02:17.530 --> 02:20.540
<i>We must survive in a world where</i>
<i>common sense and moral values</i>

02:20.540 --> 02:21.910
<i>are being rewritten!</i>

02:22.000 --> 02:23.580
Shut up!

02:23.620 --> 02:27.130
I'd rather die
than side with the monsters!

02:27.920 --> 02:28.040
MONSTER

02:28.040 --> 02:32.970
MONSTER
Very well!
You can be the first sacrifice!

02:33.220 --> 02:34.380
Get him!

02:35.890 --> 02:37.550
Hey, wait up!

02:38.220 --> 02:39.260
No!

02:42.680 --> 02:46.350
Offering up sacrifices just
to save yourselves...

02:46.600 --> 02:49.110
You're underestimating monsters
way too much, you bastards.

02:49.610 --> 02:54.360
<i>I'm disappointed at how easily</i>
<i>human society can be shaken.</i>

02:55.070 --> 02:59.160
<i>If things are already like this,</i>
<i>I'm worried that</i>

02:59.160 --> 03:02.700
<i>when I make my dramatic entrance</i>
<i>as the most powerful monster</i>

03:02.700 --> 03:04.290
<i>it won't make much of an impact.</i>

03:04.580 --> 03:04.830
MONSTER TRAITS

03:04.830 --> 03:07.880
MONSTER TRAITS
<i>In several areas, some citizens</i>
<i>have caused outbreaks of violence</i>

03:07.880 --> 03:09.000
MONSTER TRAITS
<i>carrying out robberies, burglaries,</i>
<i>and purse-snatchings.</i>

03:09.000 --> 03:10.130
<i>carrying out robberies, burglaries,</i>
<i>and purse-snatchings.</i>

03:10.300 --> 03:12.840
<i>Police and heroes are working</i>
<i>side by side</i>

03:12.840 --> 03:14.670
<i>patrolling the streets and urging caution.</i>

03:15.630 --> 03:17.220
<i>In City S,</i>
<i>another group has appeared</i>

03:17.220 --> 03:20.180
<i>proclaiming that the end of</i>
<i>human history has come</i>

03:20.180 --> 03:23.640
<i>spreading confusion as</i>
<i>they march through the streets.</i>

03:24.520 --> 03:26.640
<i>Just because monsters</i>
<i>are on a rampage</i>

03:26.640 --> 03:29.270
<i>it doesn't mean</i>
<i>your own crimes are excused.</i>

03:30.150 --> 03:33.030
<i>The Monster Association</i>
<i>half-asses everything</i>

03:33.150 --> 03:35.820
<i>and that's why those loudmouthed punks</i>
<i>get more brazen...</i>

03:36.910 --> 03:37.910
What do you want?

03:37.910 --> 03:39.780
You bumped into me
old man.

03:39.950 --> 03:42.160
Got any complaints?

03:42.910 --> 03:45.120
Shut up. He bumped into me.

03:45.330 --> 03:47.500
He's drunk and out of control.

03:47.540 --> 03:50.750
The monsters are gonna
kill us all anyway.

03:50.750 --> 03:52.380
Why the hell should I hold back?!

03:52.800 --> 03:53.630
Hey.

03:53.960 --> 03:56.550
You're blocking the entrance.
Beat it.

03:56.880 --> 03:57.880
Huh?

03:57.930 --> 04:00.760
You say somethin'?
You punk!

04:07.270 --> 04:08.390
I said, beat it.

04:09.730 --> 04:11.560
<i>I'm not like them.</i>

04:12.360 --> 04:16.030
<i>I can unleash true terror that</i>
<i>will silence even these scumbags.</i>

04:17.320 --> 04:19.990
<i>But right now, I'm too hungry.</i>

04:21.240 --> 04:23.530
Here is your extra-thick steak
mega-eater set

04:23.530 --> 04:25.580
with a super-sized portion of rice.

04:26.200 --> 04:27.500
Please enjoy.

04:28.830 --> 04:30.500
It's a meal fit for a mammoth!

04:46.850 --> 04:47.730
Hm?

04:48.230 --> 04:50.440
This isn't nearly enough.

04:52.480 --> 04:55.110
Give me everything on this meat menu
from top to bottom.

04:55.730 --> 04:57.740
I'll also take every kind
of salad you have.

04:58.070 --> 04:59.780
Oh yeah, and also give me
a ton of water.

05:05.990 --> 05:07.250
I'd like to order more.

05:07.580 --> 05:09.580
CRUNCH CRUNCH
NOM NOM

05:09.580 --> 05:11.500
CHOMP CHOMP
MUNCH MUNCH

05:11.620 --> 05:13.460
CRUNCH CRUNCH
CHOMP CHOMP

05:13.540 --> 05:16.420
CHOMP CHOMP
MUNCH MUNCH

05:20.380 --> 05:22.760
GULP GULP

05:23.010 --> 05:24.010
SLAM

05:30.060 --> 05:32.770
<i>I'm stuffed.</i>
<i>That was a meal fit for a baboon!</i>

05:33.270 --> 05:34.440
Now then...

05:36.570 --> 05:37.530
Hm?

05:38.940 --> 05:40.240
<i>My wallet's gone!</i>

05:41.740 --> 05:44.910
<i>Did I drop it back at the supermarket</i>
<i>when I bought napa cabbage?</i>

05:45.700 --> 05:47.080
<i>Oh...crap.</i>

05:47.950 --> 05:50.830
<i>I could call Genos,</i>
<i>but he's broken right now.</i>

05:53.880 --> 05:56.790
<i>This month's lunch special</i>
<i>is fried deep-sea fish.</i>

05:57.090 --> 05:59.460
<i>Although public safety is a concern</i>

05:59.460 --> 06:03.050
<i>our restaurant maintains</i>
<i>strict security measures</i>

06:03.050 --> 06:05.430
<i>against robbery, violence,</i>
<i>and dine-and-dash incidents.</i>

06:07.720 --> 06:11.140
<i>A former pro hero is also stationed</i>
<i>in our security office.</i>

06:11.270 --> 06:14.770
<i>So you can dine without worry.</i>

06:15.230 --> 06:18.480
<i>Damn... After hearing that announcement,</i>
<i>if I tell a waiter about my situation</i>

06:18.480 --> 06:20.820
<i>it'll just look like I got scared</i>
<i>and turned myself in.</i>

06:21.780 --> 06:23.650
<i>Oh crap, what a mess.</i>

06:24.160 --> 06:27.620
<i>This is the biggest crisis</i>
<i>I've faced all year.</i>

06:28.580 --> 06:29.410
<i>Hey you!</i>

06:29.410 --> 06:31.040
This could be the end for me.

06:31.040 --> 06:31.950
<i>I'm talking to you!</i>

06:32.830 --> 06:33.870
Saitama!

06:33.870 --> 06:36.330
No, it's not what it looks like!
I was just...!

06:36.630 --> 06:37.750
What are you talking about?

06:38.290 --> 06:40.710
Huh? What're you doing here?

06:41.010 --> 06:43.630
Jeez, I looked all over
for you, Saitama!

06:43.970 --> 06:46.800
You left in the middle
of our conversation!

06:47.180 --> 06:49.970
So, you're looking for
the Hero Hunter, right?

06:50.520 --> 06:53.940
Fine then.
I'll help you out.

06:54.310 --> 06:55.850
Excuse me, I'd like to add to my order.

06:55.850 --> 06:58.270
- In return, I'm taking...
- One extra large fries.

06:58.270 --> 06:59.980
...70% of the points as a success fee.

07:00.650 --> 07:04.280
You've quickly risen to
Class B, Rank 7.

07:04.280 --> 07:06.660
But it'll be hard to climb
higher from there.

07:07.450 --> 07:12.790
If this goes well, reaching top five
of Class B is definitely possible.

07:13.160 --> 07:17.330
But for that,
you'll need my cooperation.

07:17.830 --> 07:19.500
You probably
don't even know anything

07:19.500 --> 07:23.050
about your target or
their facial features, right?

07:23.130 --> 07:27.430
Honestly, you're hopeless.
I'll provide you with the intel.

07:27.510 --> 07:27.840
DAZE

07:27.840 --> 07:30.970
DAZE
From now on, you will follow
my instructions and act accordingly...

07:30.970 --> 07:31.720
DAZE

07:31.720 --> 07:32.810
DAZE
You listening?

07:32.810 --> 07:32.930
DAZE

07:33.220 --> 07:35.350
Your fries, sir. Please enjoy.

07:41.230 --> 07:42.190
You're sharing with me?

07:44.610 --> 07:45.490
Thanks.

07:51.450 --> 07:53.410
<i>What's with that grin?</i>

07:54.080 --> 07:57.000
<i>He must be thrilled to</i>
<i>be working with me.</i>

07:57.420 --> 08:00.330
<i>Maybe Saitama will now join</i>
<i>the Blizzard Bunch.</i>

08:00.420 --> 08:02.040
A dine-and-dasher!

08:02.170 --> 08:03.920
But I haven't done it yet!

08:04.050 --> 08:06.510
Someone catch that guy!

08:08.970 --> 08:10.470
Dine and dashing is a terrible crime.

08:10.470 --> 08:12.140
- I'll go after him.
- Hey... Saitama?!

08:12.180 --> 08:15.060
You ate a fry, right?
The bill's on you!

08:18.310 --> 08:22.650
<i>One...fry?</i>
<i>Are you kidding me?</i>

08:22.860 --> 08:25.230
<i>The world's falling apart and</i>

08:25.230 --> 08:27.240
<i>he's being this petty?</i>

08:30.160 --> 08:32.740
Guess a marathon was still
a bit too much for me.

08:34.290 --> 08:36.250
It would be better to heal your wounds

08:36.250 --> 08:38.460
under the protection of
the Monster Association.

08:38.790 --> 08:43.340
But first, you'll need to
fulfill a condition.

08:44.090 --> 08:46.630
"Bring back a hero's head," huh...?

08:47.300 --> 08:50.010
So if you kill a hero,
you're officially considered a monster?

08:50.010 --> 08:51.430
What kind of logic is that?

08:51.890 --> 08:57.020
Monsters should be able to incite
absolute fear with their mere presence.

08:58.940 --> 09:01.060
Oh man, my head hurts...

09:06.780 --> 09:07.990
Who cares.

09:11.740 --> 09:15.240
Hey Tareo, how did you get out alive?

09:15.370 --> 09:17.450
Maybe you're a monster too!

09:17.450 --> 09:19.620
Yeah, an ugly monster!

09:19.620 --> 09:21.830
Oww, that hurts!

09:25.340 --> 09:26.460
Knock it off!

09:27.380 --> 09:29.420
- Mommy!
- Mommy!

09:31.050 --> 09:33.260
Look at that ugly cry-face.

09:33.680 --> 09:36.310
No wonder they bully you.
Poor kid.

09:38.020 --> 09:41.140
Hey, what are the odds
we meet twice on the same day.

09:41.190 --> 09:42.020
Old dude?!

09:42.100 --> 09:42.140
Don't call me, old. I'm only 18!

09:42.140 --> 09:43.020
SNAP
Don't call me, old. I'm only 18!

09:43.020 --> 09:44.480
Don't call me, old. I'm only 18!

09:46.980 --> 09:49.280
Hurry up and go home.
The sun's going down.

09:49.740 --> 09:51.780
Monsters might come out again.

09:54.370 --> 09:55.530
Old dude...

09:56.990 --> 09:57.950
Sorry...

09:59.160 --> 10:01.210
For running away earlier today.

10:03.790 --> 10:04.630
Huh?

10:05.460 --> 10:08.130
I saw everything...

10:09.170 --> 10:15.050
The heroes were trying to kill you,
but that was a mistake, right?

10:15.430 --> 10:20.680
After all, you protected me from
the bullets that time!

10:21.100 --> 10:23.980
And just now. You saved me again.

10:24.690 --> 10:26.900
I bet you're a champion of justice and—

10:28.230 --> 10:31.070
Cut it out.
You're giving me goosebumps.

10:31.320 --> 10:33.030
Hey, dine-and-dasher!

10:34.200 --> 10:35.660
Hey, dine-and-dasher!

10:36.240 --> 10:38.410
You scumbag!
How dare you leave without paying!

10:38.450 --> 10:39.450
Is that a hero?

10:39.450 --> 10:41.950
Your timing was perfect, you scumbag!

10:41.950 --> 10:43.250
So, I'll let it slide this time!

10:43.330 --> 10:44.580
Wait, what do you mean?

10:44.580 --> 10:46.420
Okay, so let this be your warning.

10:46.830 --> 10:48.880
Didn't you come to fight me?

10:49.090 --> 10:51.880
Are you scared now?
What's your hero name?

10:57.220 --> 10:59.600
Cape...Caped Baldy.

11:00.140 --> 11:03.640
<i>Huh? I didn't catch that.</i>
<i>But he does look like a hero.</i>

11:04.520 --> 11:06.980
<i>He may be a small fry,</i>
<i>but I'll hunt any hero.</i>

11:07.900 --> 11:11.530
He's not even in the Hero Almanac,
so I bet he's new.

11:11.690 --> 11:13.110
Go home, kid.

11:14.990 --> 11:17.620
Old dude... Did you dine and dash?

11:17.990 --> 11:20.870
He said he'll let it go,
so don't hassle him.

11:24.500 --> 11:25.960
<i>What a joke.</i>

11:27.040 --> 11:29.210
<i>If I start getting pity</i>
<i>from the Monster Association</i>

11:29.210 --> 11:33.920
<i>and even from small-time heroes and brats,</i>
<i>then I'm really done for.</i>

11:34.920 --> 11:37.590
<i>When I heard that</i>
<i>the old geezer survived, I felt relieved.</i>

11:37.590 --> 11:40.050
<i>It makes me sick to think</i>
<i>that I felt that way.</i>

11:40.850 --> 11:42.810
<i>Whatever the definition of a monster is</i>

11:42.810 --> 11:45.850
<i>it's clear I don't have</i>
<i>the resolve to be one.</i>

11:46.690 --> 11:48.020
<i>I'll do it.</i>

11:48.600 --> 11:51.230
<i>If a hero's head is what you want,</i>
<i>I'll get you one.</i>

11:51.820 --> 11:55.150
<i>Don't underestimate me...</i>
<i>I'm a monster.</i>

11:57.360 --> 12:00.410
Hey, you're mine!

12:01.280 --> 12:04.370
Sorry, I'm just as guilty as you,
so I can't be seen with you.

12:10.290 --> 12:11.420
Oops...

12:12.590 --> 12:13.750
I screwed up.

12:14.630 --> 12:16.840
I didn't mean to knock him out.

12:18.090 --> 12:20.300
<i>Oh great, a witness.</i>

12:20.550 --> 12:21.680
<i>What's that book?</i>

12:22.180 --> 12:24.600
<i>Of all people, it had</i>
<i>to be some hero-obsessed kid.</i>

12:25.560 --> 12:28.940
<i>Guess my cover's blown.</i>
<i>Damn it.</i>

12:30.100 --> 12:32.400
Hey kid, do you know who I am?

12:34.480 --> 12:35.320
Huh?

12:35.740 --> 12:36.740
HERO ALMANAC

12:36.740 --> 12:38.150
HERO ALMANAC
Let me take a look at that.

12:38.150 --> 12:38.650
HERO ALMANAC

12:40.490 --> 12:41.410
Are you serious?

12:42.070 --> 12:43.490
I'm not even listed in here.

12:44.200 --> 12:45.160
Figures...

12:48.540 --> 12:49.870
<i>Who was that?</i>

12:50.920 --> 12:52.420
I almost forgot!

12:52.750 --> 12:53.710
Old dude!

12:53.710 --> 12:55.500
Wake up, old dude!

12:57.010 --> 12:58.170
One-Punch Man!

13:02.050 --> 13:03.300
One-Punch Man!

13:18.360 --> 13:20.110
You okay, old dude?

13:20.530 --> 13:24.580
That bald hero guy said, "I screwed up"
and ran away.

13:25.410 --> 13:28.620
I lost...?!
W-What kind of hero was he?

13:28.950 --> 13:30.540
You don't remember?

13:30.870 --> 13:32.880
Maybe he hit your head in a bad spot.

13:34.170 --> 13:38.090
Garou, what's going on?

13:42.260 --> 13:44.140
We've been watching you the whole time.

13:45.220 --> 13:48.770
You're not like us, Garou.

13:49.520 --> 13:52.940
Yeah, that's right.
It's a shame but...

13:53.270 --> 13:56.730
You lack the qualities of
a true monster.

13:58.650 --> 14:02.570
Hey kid...
Stop staring and go home.

14:03.360 --> 14:05.950
These guys wanna have a word with me.

14:06.370 --> 14:07.410
Huh?

14:15.380 --> 14:19.670
He's in my almanac.
It wasn't just hearsay.

14:21.380 --> 14:23.430
W-What is he doing...here?

14:23.430 --> 14:24.340
URBAN LEGEND MONSTER
KING THE RIPPER
W-What is he doing...here?

14:24.340 --> 14:24.970
URBAN LEGEND MONSTER
KING THE RIPPER

14:25.970 --> 14:30.270
That's King the Ripper.
He's abducted many kids.

14:31.270 --> 14:33.520
It's King the Ripperrrr!!

14:34.690 --> 14:36.360
Hey! Pull yourself together!

14:36.610 --> 14:38.230
Stop crying and get up!

14:38.360 --> 14:42.950
Who knew you had such
a small friend, Garou.

14:43.280 --> 14:45.450
Hey, stop! Talk from over there!

14:45.740 --> 14:48.120
Oh my...sorry.

14:48.580 --> 14:53.330
I didn't mean to make you cry yet.
My bad.

14:54.000 --> 14:58.960
I was planning to savor
those screams later.

14:59.210 --> 15:00.800
Sorry about that.

15:01.210 --> 15:02.970
Ah, you poor thing.

15:03.090 --> 15:06.590
I'll make sure to chop up
every last inch of your body to pieces.

15:06.590 --> 15:08.100
Forgive me.

15:09.890 --> 15:11.390
Little boy...

15:11.520 --> 15:14.440
You're doomed. Sorry.

15:16.150 --> 15:17.270
Stay back.

15:21.900 --> 15:22.780
Pardon me.

15:23.030 --> 15:24.320
I'd like to ask a question.

15:24.400 --> 15:27.910
I hate to be interrupted
when I'm meditating. What is it?

15:28.370 --> 15:31.080
Why did you send King the Ripper
and Insect God?

15:31.200 --> 15:32.580
If it was just for observation

15:32.620 --> 15:34.910
you didn't need to send
those two brutes.

15:35.160 --> 15:37.880
Why not? They may actually
get along surprisingly well.

15:37.880 --> 15:38.880
Don't be ridiculous.

15:39.250 --> 15:41.710
Those two never follow orders.

15:41.880 --> 15:44.170
They'll probably get carried away
and kill Garou.

15:44.630 --> 15:48.390
Especially King the Ripper.
He's a rare breed that kills for pleasure.

15:48.590 --> 15:52.140
Even the other monsters
won't go near him.

15:52.350 --> 15:54.350
Exactly, that was my point.

15:54.480 --> 15:56.140
I let them make contact with Garou

15:56.140 --> 15:59.150
so that it would stimulate him
and promote his growth.

15:59.150 --> 16:00.150
Growth?

16:00.400 --> 16:03.650
This is a trial for that indecisive boy.

16:03.820 --> 16:07.360
First, we need to
tear apart his body and his mind

16:07.360 --> 16:08.820
until they are in tatters...

16:09.240 --> 16:11.700
I look forward to seeing
how he changes

16:11.700 --> 16:14.160
after experiencing monsters firsthand.

16:14.410 --> 16:17.290
Gyoro-Gyoro, what are you after?

16:17.540 --> 16:20.040
What do you really intend
to do with Garou?

16:20.290 --> 16:21.590
Why are you asking?

16:21.670 --> 16:23.800
No reason. Just curious.

16:23.880 --> 16:25.710
Listen, Phoenix Man.

16:25.840 --> 16:28.880
Where do you think
Lord Orochi came from?

16:29.130 --> 16:30.180
I don't know...

16:30.260 --> 16:32.260
Isn't he an ancient creature
or something?

16:33.430 --> 16:37.140
Lord Orochi was once human like Garou.

16:38.390 --> 16:42.900
After countless failures and sacrifices,
he finally became the ultimate lifeform.

16:43.110 --> 16:46.150
He is truly worthy of
the name, Monster King.

16:46.740 --> 16:49.200
It was I who created Lord Orochi.

16:49.320 --> 16:51.490
Created? You did?

16:51.620 --> 16:55.870
If Garou is trained properly,
he might become a second Lord Orochi.

16:56.040 --> 16:58.330
Only I know the secret to do that.

16:58.790 --> 17:01.330
I've instructed Insect God to intervene

17:01.330 --> 17:04.040
if King the Ripper goes too far
with Garou.

17:04.250 --> 17:07.050
But if he dies,
then that's just how it goes.

17:07.420 --> 17:10.720
We'll just wait for the next
suitable specimen to show up.

17:15.180 --> 17:17.980
<i>I scoped out the area and</i>
<i>sealed the back entrance.</i>

17:18.390 --> 17:21.100
<i>For the last few hours,</i>
<i>no one has come or gone but the gorilla.</i>

17:21.560 --> 17:24.940
<i>The other members are all out.</i>
<i>This is the perfect time.</i>

17:25.320 --> 17:27.480
<i>The command center is</i>
<i>probably located inside.</i>

17:27.610 --> 17:28.740
<i>Perhaps in the monitor room.</i>

17:29.450 --> 17:32.950
<i>A strange group of unidentified people</i>
<i>recently moved in.</i>

17:33.320 --> 17:35.620
<i>They've been bringing in</i>
<i>large amounts of equipment</i>

17:35.620 --> 17:36.830
<i>and mysterious powders...</i>

17:37.330 --> 17:39.790
<i>And boxes filled with putrid matter.</i>

17:40.160 --> 17:44.420
<i>The information I've gathered</i>
<i>matches my suspicions.</i>

17:45.250 --> 17:47.380
<i>No doubt about it.</i>
<i>It must be them.</i>

17:48.010 --> 17:50.380
<i>Now's the time. I'm going in.</i>

17:52.180 --> 17:57.060
Gyoro-Gyoro ordered us to
observe your actions.

17:57.180 --> 18:01.690
To determine if you're truly worthy
of joining our ranks.

18:13.320 --> 18:14.990
Hero Hunter...

18:15.120 --> 18:20.830
Are you just some freak who gets off
on pretending to be a monster?

18:21.080 --> 18:22.830
Or are you a true monster?

18:23.120 --> 18:25.580
Hmph. Look at you,
talking all high and mighty.

18:25.750 --> 18:29.210
I was just getting sick of
how soft you guys are.

18:29.420 --> 18:31.670
Fine then. Kill that boy.

18:31.760 --> 18:34.430
Huh? What do you mean?

18:34.760 --> 18:38.430
A monster is one who has
abandoned being human.

18:38.470 --> 18:40.810
A being severed from
the world of humans.

18:41.060 --> 18:44.730
I saw you help that boy.

18:44.810 --> 18:47.150
That is unacceptable.
You must kill him.

18:47.690 --> 18:50.110
In order to join
the Monster Association

18:50.110 --> 18:53.400
you must work hard to gain our trust.

18:53.700 --> 18:56.740
But you haven't fully let go
of being human.

18:56.910 --> 19:00.200
We don't need any half-hearted types.

19:00.370 --> 19:02.000
We're building
an organization that will

19:02.000 --> 19:04.000
destroy human society
and take control.

19:04.080 --> 19:06.000
We kill kids off like their nothing.

19:06.250 --> 19:09.290
And just now, you even lost
to that mediocre hero.

19:09.500 --> 19:10.880
Even if you were caught off guard

19:10.880 --> 19:12.800
I doubt how useful you'd be in combat.

19:13.340 --> 19:17.430
Hey, I already told you.
Hurry up and go home, kid.

19:18.390 --> 19:21.180
My legs are shaking...
I can't move.

19:22.140 --> 19:23.640
I can't move!!

19:23.850 --> 19:24.810
You idiot!

19:25.060 --> 19:28.440
Don't think someone will help you
because you can't stand up.

19:28.730 --> 19:30.480
No one's gonna help you.

19:30.480 --> 19:32.730
You have to protect yourself.

19:33.110 --> 19:36.160
In moments like this,
the only choice is to become stronger!

19:38.030 --> 19:39.660
<i>You need to get strong.</i>

19:40.910 --> 19:42.540
Stand up! Tareo!!

20:22.740 --> 20:23.620
Run!!

20:25.200 --> 20:26.580
It's too late.

20:26.910 --> 20:29.670
You're our enemy now.

20:29.960 --> 20:33.460
You call yourself the Hero Hunter,
yet you haven't killed a single soul.

20:33.590 --> 20:36.170
Just like I thought,
you're a spineless wimp.

20:36.840 --> 20:39.550
I don't like your attitude.

20:43.600 --> 20:44.560
Come on!

22:19.780 --> 22:23.160
At last... I've finally tracked them down.

22:23.780 --> 22:28.120
My archenemies I've hunted for years,
the ones most entwined with my fate.

22:29.040 --> 22:32.500
The worst organization in history
that's plotting to wipe out humanity

22:32.500 --> 22:34.250
and reshape the world.

22:35.210 --> 22:40.090
I had started to suspect
their true identity from recent events.

22:40.380 --> 22:43.180
But I could never get a solid lead.

22:44.380 --> 22:47.350
Shibabawa prophesized
that the Earth is in danger.

22:47.720 --> 22:51.310
They are pulling the strings behind
the so-called Monster Association.

22:52.180 --> 22:54.140
They're the true masterminds
behind it all.

22:55.100 --> 22:56.560
No doubt about it!

23:00.280 --> 23:01.110
HOUSE OF TAKOYAKI

23:01.490 --> 23:03.240
It's over for you!

23:03.320 --> 23:04.530
The House of Evolution!

23:05.070 --> 23:06.910
Oh? A customer?

23:07.280 --> 23:08.700
You're a customer, aren't you?

23:09.910 --> 23:11.290
You keep relocating your base

23:11.290 --> 23:13.250
and this time, your front is
a takoyaki stand?

23:13.830 --> 23:15.170
What a joke.

23:15.830 --> 23:17.880
I already know your little schemes.

23:18.210 --> 23:19.250
I won't be fooled.

23:19.800 --> 23:21.250
Hold on, okay?

23:21.380 --> 23:23.170
We're still getting ready.

23:24.800 --> 23:27.590
I am now a hero called Zombieman.

23:27.930 --> 23:29.890
The one with a body that can't die.

23:31.060 --> 23:35.270
Maybe Experimental Sample
No. 66 rings a bell?

23:35.560 --> 23:38.810
Huh? You're a hero who's come to
take down the House of Evolution?

23:39.020 --> 23:42.530
Sorry, but the House of Evolution
has already been destroyed.

23:46.570 --> 23:50.490
Well...you want to come inside?

23:50.830 --> 23:52.540
I've got some free time now.

23:53.410 --> 23:55.960
TO BE CONTINUED

23:56.000 --> 24:00.900
ORGANISM LIMITS
